{"title":"2022 SSMO Relay Round 5 Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_SSMO_Relay_Round_5_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/7/1970593e80703dfe31ef799575bae2ee9819ced1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8\\times 8$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> chessboard with a knight in one of the center squares. The knight may move in an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />-shaped fashion, going two squares in one direction and one square in a perpendicular direction, but cannot go outside the chessboard. How many squares can the knight reach in exactly two moves?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_SSMO_Relay_Round_5_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<center> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/6/3163573ca579f215f3369a078bb8e584c1dcf97f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(8cm); filldraw((0,0)--(1,0)--(1,1)--(0,1)--cycle,lightblue); filldraw((1,0)--(2,0)--(2,1)--(1,1)--cycle,white); filldraw((2,0)--(3,0)--(3,1)--(2,1)--cycle,lightblue); filldraw((3,0)--(4,0)--(4,1)--(3,1)--cycle,white); filldraw((4,0)--(5,0)--(5,1)--(4,1)--cycle,lightblue); filldraw((5,0)--(6,0)--(6,1)--(5,1)--cycle,white); filldraw((6,0)--(7,0)--(7,1)--(6,1)--cycle,lightblue); filldraw((7,0)--(8,0)--(8,1)--(7,1)--cycle,white);  filldraw((0,1)--(1,1)--(1,2)--(0,2)--cycle,white); filldraw((1,1)--(2,1)--(2,2)--(1,2)--cycle,lightgray); filldraw((2,1)--(3,1)--(3,2)--(2,2)--cycle,lightgreen); filldraw((3,1)--(4,1)--(4,2)--(3,2)--cycle,lightblue); filldraw((4,1)--(5,1)--(5,2)--(4,2)--cycle,lightgreen); filldraw((5,1)--(6,1)--(6,2)--(5,2)--cycle,lightgray); filldraw((6,1)--(7,1)--(7,2)--(6,2)--cycle,white); filldraw((7,1)--(8,1)--(8,2)--(7,2)--cycle,lightblue);  filldraw((0,2)--(1,2)--(1,3)--(0,3)--cycle,lightblue); filldraw((1,2)--(2,2)--(2,3)--(1,3)--cycle,lightgreen); filldraw((2,2)--(3,2)--(3,3)--(2,3)--cycle,lightblue); filldraw((3,2)--(4,2)--(4,3)--(3,3)--cycle,white); filldraw((4,2)--(5,2)--(5,3)--(4,3)--cycle,lightblue); filldraw((5,2)--(6,2)--(6,3)--(5,3)--cycle,lightgreen); filldraw((6,2)--(7,2)--(7,3)--(6,3)--cycle,lightblue); filldraw((7,2)--(8,2)--(8,3)--(7,3)--cycle,white);  filldraw((0,3)--(1,3)--(1,4)--(0,4)--cycle,white); filldraw((1,3)--(2,3)--(2,4)--(1,4)--cycle,lightblue); filldraw((2,3)--(3,3)--(3,4)--(2,4)--cycle,white); filldraw((3,3)--(4,3)--(4,4)--(3,4)--cycle,lightblue); filldraw((4,3)--(5,3)--(5,4)--(4,4)--cycle,white); filldraw((5,3)--(6,3)--(6,4)--(5,4)--cycle,lightblue); filldraw((6,3)--(7,3)--(7,4)--(6,4)--cycle,white); filldraw((7,3)--(8,3)--(8,4)--(7,4)--cycle,lightblue);  filldraw((0,4)--(1,4)--(1,5)--(0,5)--cycle,lightblue); filldraw((1,4)--(2,4)--(2,5)--(1,5)--cycle,lightgreen); filldraw((2,4)--(3,4)--(3,5)--(2,5)--cycle,lightblue); filldraw((3,4)--(4,4)--(4,5)--(3,5)--cycle,white); filldraw((4,4)--(5,4)--(5,5)--(4,5)--cycle,lightblue); filldraw((5,4)--(6,4)--(6,5)--(5,5)--cycle,lightgreen); filldraw((6,4)--(7,4)--(7,5)--(6,5)--cycle,lightblue); filldraw((7,4)--(8,4)--(8,5)--(7,5)--cycle,white);  filldraw((0,5)--(1,5)--(1,6)--(0,6)--cycle,white); filldraw((1,5)--(2,5)--(2,6)--(1,6)--cycle,lightgray); filldraw((2,5)--(3,5)--(3,6)--(2,6)--cycle,lightgreen); filldraw((3,5)--(4,5)--(4,6)--(3,6)--cycle,lightblue); fil